Subject: [PATCH 015/164] [WORKAROUND]: KVM: TDX: Prevent WARN_ON() when
 unloading KVM

Currently, Sean's patch

  KVM: Add a module param to allow enabling virtualization when KVM is loaded

may have an issue, which can result in below WARN() when TDX is enabled:

[ 2647.358492] WARNING: CPU: 131 PID: 4348 at arch/x86/kvm/../../../virt/kvm/kvm_main.c:5763 kvm_exit+0xc5/0xe0 [kvm]

