 - Include "x86_ops.h" to tdx.c as the patch to initialize TDX module
   doesn't include it anymore.
 - Introduce tdx_vm_ioctl() as the first tdx func in x86_ops.h
 - Drop middle paragraph in the commit log (Tony)

