Subject: [PATCH 092/164] KVM: TDX: Add a place holder to handle TDX VM exit

Wire up .get_exit_info(), .handle_exit(), and .handle_exit_irqoff()
and add a place holder to handle VM exit.  Add helper functions to get
exit info, exit qualification, etc.

Suggested-by: Sean Christopherson <seanjc@google.com>
Signed-off-by: Isaku Yamahata <isaku.yamahata@intel.com>
Co-developed-by: Binbin Wu <binbin.wu@linux.intel.com>
