From 1d1dba820b07b24c7a2a082184b1bcc0615060fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Afranji <afranji@google.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Jun 2024 01:59:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 144/164] KVM: selftests: TDX: Add shared memory test

Adds a test that sets up shared memory between the host and guest.

Signed-off-by: Ryan Afranji <afranji@google.com>
